      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَفِيفٌ</span></b>  <i>Little in quantity:</i> (S, O, Msb, K:)
and <i>incomplete:</i> (IDrd, O, K:) applied to a
thing in this sense, (IDrd, O,) and in the former
sense. (TA.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِفْلٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Low, base,
vile, mean, paltry,</i> or <i>contemptible.</i> (TA.)

